{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.poster.avif?t=1751048692\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.webm?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.mp4?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1751048692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1751048692 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.<br>Precise physics with accessible controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/5185c268f9187bc8894edc46ab1fdfbd.avif?t=1751048692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/5185c268f9187bc8894edc46ab1fdfbd.avif?t=1751048692 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The drifting system strikes a balance between realism and flow, making touge mastery an art \u2014 not a fight against the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a carefully crafted selection of cars inspired by drifting legends. Each one has its own handling and character. No complicated customization \u2014 just you and the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1751048692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras_big/a54239e01eba9dca30655b73d833de8a.avif?t=1751048692 width=800 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack pays tribute to the VHS and neon era with a soundtrack that follows every descent like a scene from an anime. <br><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> isn\u2019t just a racing game. It\u2019s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night\u2026 and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719540?t=1751048692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/93e2a8cb4dccc29a99121c658b41c63d047a248f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751048692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/bb2c7f7a4cb395d44f82ae474a862bd776a7de15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751048692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/bb2c7f7a4cb395d44f82ae474a862bd776a7de15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751048692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.poster.avif?t=1751048692\" width=320 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.webm?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/4cd3fe00784b19c51b7c2aa1dc0ade60.mp4?t=1751048692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</strong></i> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/6d6808c1f054bff6f2a78b2815dd5e01.avif?t=1751048692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akama